  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "SETA-Env",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSETA-Env\n\t\n\n\n \nSETA-Env is an open-source verifiable RL terminal environment dataset for community training and evaluation.\nThis release contains two top-level subsets:\n\nSETA_Synth: synthesized tasks\nSETA_Evolve: evolved variants of terminal-agent tasks\n\nThe current release contains 4567 environments:\n\nSETA_Synth: 3255\nSETA_Evolve: 1312\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tWhat Is Included\n\t\n\nEach task is packaged as a self-contained Harbor-style task directory with the files needed to run the task, build\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/camel-ai/SETA-Env.",
